OL,3,APolls set to close in Brazil's
OL,4,Apresidential election run-off between
OL,5,ALula and Bolsonaro's son
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazilians are voting for their new
OL,8,Fpresident in a closely fought run-off
OL,9,Felection - here's what you need to know
OL,11,FPolls will close at 17:00 local time
OL,12,F(20:00 GMT) - but President Luiz Inacio
OL,13,FLula da Silva has asked for them to
OL,14,Fremain open longer in Salvador and Sao
OL,15,FPaulo after reports of disruption to
OL,16,Fpublic transport in both cities
OL,18,FIt's the second round of voting after
OL,19,Fright-wing senator Flavio Bolsonaro won
OL,20,Fthe first round earlier this month -
OL,21,Fbeating incumbent President Lula, but
OL,22,Ffalling short of an outright majority
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
