OL,3,APolls set to close in Brazil's
OL,4,Apresidential election run-off between
OL,5,ALula and Bolsonaro's son
OL,6,
OL,7,FArriving at a polling station in Rio de
OL,8,FJaneiro early this morning, Bolsonaro
OL,9,Ftold reporters the "time has come for
OL,10,Freal change"
OL,12,FMeanwhile, Lula greeted supporters
OL,13,Foutside a polling station as he cast
OL,14,Fhis vote in Sao Bernardo do Campo
OL,16,FVoters are marking their allegiances in
OL,17,Fred, green and yellow, our
OL,18,Fcorrespondent in Brasilia writes
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
